  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.0.15\n- Replaces the portal's direct proposal mutations with a protected, selection-driven agent prompt builder backed by server-owned templates.\n- Aligns role-aware change approval, closure, and whole-feature review across the CLI, MCP, core policy, and portal.\n- Re-hashes test-campaign artifacts before acceptance and requires story campaigns to trace the story plus every governed change.\n- Hardens knowledge-only MCP sessions with a fail-closed tool surface and verifies the exact packaged MCP contract in CI and release smoke tests.\n- Improves portal policy guidance, responsive navigation, mobile header layout, decision controls, and pointer target sizing.\n- Expands dependency auditing to development dependencies, gives this materially changed tool surface a new immutable package version, and attests release provenance plus a validated CycloneDX SBOM covering both the .NET runtime and embedded React bundle.",
